Package: floaties
Title: Waterfall and Swimlane Plots for Medical Data Review
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vedha", "Viyash", , "vedha@appsilon.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Create waterfall and swimlane plots for clinical and medical
    data review using a choice of graphics engines: 'ggplot2', 'plotly',
    or 'echarts4r'. Functions accept any data frame that follows a simple,
    documented structure, and columns are supplied with tidy evaluation,
    so the same code works with 'SDTM', 'ADaM', or any other data
    standard.
